{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o117a","title":"胡综主张长吏违科奔丧处死无赦","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o117a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"胡综主张长吏违科奔丧处死无赦","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o117a-q"]},{"id":"shiyi-a-809da45c07848b0ee57f","label":"正文","text":"孙权禁长吏奔丧，胡综议以大辟并获采纳","evidence":["shiyi-q-4abc75ee19b18a8d1b8a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0091","role":"议制","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o117a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"立科并采纳议者","evidence":["shiyi-q-4abc75ee19b18a8d1b8a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"议奔丧科时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o117a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o117a-q","source_order":[47,591,"O117a"],"order":8333}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0091","name":"胡综","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-4abc75ee19b18a8d1b8a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1014cbd7fb1d674df9bc","layer":"original","quote":"初，以内外多事，特立科〖4〗：“长吏遭丧〖5〗，皆不得去〖6〗。”而数有犯者，权患之，使朝臣下议〖7〗。综议以为：“宜定科文，示以大辟〖8〗。行之一人，其后必绝。”遂用综言，由是奔丧乃断。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":66,"end":160},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o117a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-94a4a3aebdf319e44773","layer":"original","quote":"将军胡综议〖29〗，以为：“丧纪之礼〖30〗，虽有典制；苟无其时，所不得行。方今戎事，军国异容〖31〗；而长吏遭丧，知有科禁，公敢干突〖32〗；苟念闻忧不奔之耻〖33〗，不计为臣犯禁之罪：此由科防本轻所致。忠节在国，孝道立家；出身为臣，焉得兼之！故为忠臣，不得为孝子。宜定科文，示以大辟；若故违犯，有罪无赦。以杀止杀：行之一人，其后必绝。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":170}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
